<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MoneyGram started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MoneyGram started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it started coverage of MoneyGram Payment Systems Inc with a neutral rating.  </p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed Friday at 13-5/8 and had not yet opened for trading on the NYSE.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
